{"title":"Binary search, drawn","desc":"Boxes for each array value, with pointers for low, mid and high.","summary":"Binary search finds a value in a sorted list by checking the middle and throwing away the half that cannot hold it. Each check halves what is left, so even a long list needs only a few looks. It only works when the list is sorted.","input":{"label":"Look for","options":["23","5"]},"variants":[{"steps":[{"note":"Look for 23. The whole array is still in play.","scene":{"rows":[{"id":"a","label":"Array","items":[{"text":"3"},{"text":"8"},{"text":"12"},{"text":"17"},{"text":"23"},{"text":"31"},{"text":"42"},{"text":"56"}]}],"pointers":[{"at":"a.0","text":"lo"},{"at":"a.7","text":"hi"}]}},{"note":"17 is too small, so the left half goes.","scene":{"rows":[{"id":"a","label":"Array","items":[{"text":"3","state":"dim"},{"text":"8","state":"dim"},{"text":"12","state":"dim"},{"text":"17","state":"active"},{"text":"23"},{"text":"31"},{"text":"42"},{"text":"56"}]}],"pointers":[{"at":"a.3","text":"mid","tone":"primary"}]}},{"note":"31 is too big, so the right half goes.","scene":{"rows":[{"id":"a","label":"Array","items":[{"text":"3","state":"dim"},{"text":"8","state":"dim"},{"text":"12","state":"dim"},{"text":"17","state":"dim"},{"text":"23"},{"text":"31","state":"active"},{"text":"42","state":"dim"},{"text":"56","state":"dim"}]}],"pointers":[{"at":"a.5","text":"mid","tone":"primary"}]}},{"note":"23 is at index 4. Found it.","scene":{"rows":[{"id":"a","label":"Array","items":[{"text":"3","state":"dim"},{"text":"8","state":"dim"},{"text":"12","state":"dim"},{"text":"17","state":"dim"},{"text":"23","state":"hit"},{"text":"31","state":"dim"},{"text":"42","state":"dim"},{"text":"56","state":"dim"}]}],"focus":["a.4"]}}]},{"steps":[{"note":"Look for 5. The whole array is still in play.","scene":{"rows":[{"id":"a","label":"Array","items":[{"text":"3"},{"text":"8"},{"text":"12"},{"text":"17"},{"text":"23"},{"text":"31"},{"text":"42"},{"text":"56"}]}],"pointers":[{"at":"a.0","text":"lo"},{"at":"a.7","text":"hi"}]}},{"note":"17 is too big, so the right half goes.","scene":{"rows":[{"id":"a","label":"Array","items":[{"text":"3"},{"text":"8"},{"text":"12"},{"text":"17","state":"active"},{"text":"23","state":"dim"},{"text":"31","state":"dim"},{"text":"42","state":"dim"},{"text":"56","state":"dim"}]}],"pointers":[{"at":"a.3","text":"mid","tone":"primary"}]}},{"note":"8 is too big, so everything from 8 on goes.","scene":{"rows":[{"id":"a","label":"Array","items":[{"text":"3"},{"text":"8","state":"active"},{"text":"12","state":"dim"},{"text":"17","state":"dim"},{"text":"23","state":"dim"},{"text":"31","state":"dim"},{"text":"42","state":"dim"},{"text":"56","state":"dim"}]}],"pointers":[{"at":"a.1","text":"mid","tone":"primary"}]}},{"note":"3 is too small and nothing is left: 5 is not in the array.","scene":{"rows":[{"id":"a","label":"Array","items":[{"text":"3","state":"dim"},{"text":"8","state":"dim"},{"text":"12","state":"dim"},{"text":"17","state":"dim"},{"text":"23","state":"dim"},{"text":"31","state":"dim"},{"text":"42","state":"dim"},{"text":"56","state":"dim"}]}]}}]}]}
